# Keep text as LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# Windows CI checks out with `core.autocrlf=true`. Without `eol=lf`, a test
# that matches a marker and the next newline sees CRLF and fails. Bash and
# trybuild snapshots break the same way.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.stderr text eol=lf
